# AtomS3 Lite web-installer variant defaults.
#
# Layer this on top of the generic sdkconfig.defaults when building the
# factory image served from mullender.github.io/HomeKey-ESP32/. It flips
# NFC_READER_TYPE and NFC_ACTIVE_PRESET to the AtomS3 Lite + Unit NFC
# (ST25R3916 on Grove, SDA=G2/SCL=G1) at compile time, so a freshly
# flashed device pairs the right reader out of the box. Existing persisted
# NVS still wins on non-factory upgrades -- see main/include/defaults.h.
#
# Build:
#   idf.py -B build.installer.atoms3 \
#          -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.defaults.installer.atoms3" \
#          build
CONFIG_INSTALLER_ATOMS3_LITE_DEFAULTS=y
